  aciklama:
  - "Tamam. \u015Eunu \u015F\xF6yle yapal\u0131m..."
  - "\u015Eu \u015Furayaaa..."
  - "Bak bence \u015F\xF6yle bir \u015Fey \xE7ok mant\u0131kl\u0131."
