  - "Al bakal\u0131m!"
  - "G\xFCzel bir plan\u0131m var..."
  - "Bu ta\u015F \xE7ok i\u015F yapacak, hehe!"
  - "Derin stratejilerim gere\u011Fi \u015Fu ta\u015F\u0131 oynamal\u0131y\u0131m..."
  - "\u015Eu ta\u015F\u0131 oynayas\u0131m var ama \u015F\xFCphelerim de var. Dur
    bakal\u0131m..."
  - "\u015Eu ta\u015F oynasam tempo kaybeder miyim acaba?..."
  - "\u015Eu ta\u015Fla a\xE7\u0131k bir hat olu\u015Fturmay\u0131 planl\u0131yorum."
  - "Hmm... \u015E\xF6yle yapsam."
  - "Evet, ben de \u015F\xF6yle yapay\u0131m."
  - "Sana \u015F\xF6yle bir kar\u015F\u0131l\u0131k versem nas\u0131l olur?"
